# Collapses the several git identities each person has committed under, so
# `git shortlog`, `git log --use-mailmap`, and editor contributor panels list
# one entry per human instead of one per machine.
#
# This is display only. It does not rewrite history and has no effect on
# GitHub's own contributor graph, which keys off the account behind each email.

